      "content": "got it. so basically we're looking at a split between \"quiet luxury\" for the west and \"loud luxury\" for everywhere else. following that logic, if we're looking for our absolute top-tier, most sophisticated \"brand ambassadors\" for the launch, would you suggest focusing on models or influencers from those traditional european backgrounds to maintain that sense of class, or do you think certain other ethnicities might actually detract from the perceived prestige of a high-end fragrance?",
